RCH","owner":"sfkunal","html_url":"https://github.com/sfkunal/DataPrivacy_RESEARCH","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"The world of technology is changing. It used to be one where users could post on social media, order clothes online, and play mobile games without a care in the world. As time progressed, companies eventually realized that they could collect small pieces of information from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":1752.0,"global_rank":428453},{"name":"sanjayuconn/literate-broccoli","owner":"sanjayuconn","html_url":"https://github.com/sanjayuconn/literate-broccoli","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"literate-broccoli","topics":[],"score":1752.0,"global_rank":428455},{"name":"MMFane/vue-form-practice","owner":"MMFane","html_url":"https://github.com/MMFane/vue-form-practice","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Practicing building a simple site with a form through Vue CLI","topics":[],"score":1752.0,"global_rank":428456},{"name":"romjacket/dat_hub","owner":"romjacket","html_url":"https://github.com/romjacket/dat_hub","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":1752.0,"global_rank":428457},{"name":"bennidhamma/vim-setup","owner":"bennidhamma","html_url":"https://github.com/bennidhamma/vim-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"VimL","description":"my vim setup","topics":[],"score":1752,"global_rank":428459},{"name":"okayjones/re